  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: N/A</em></p>\n<p>You have studied languages and codes, gaining the following benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Increase your Intelligence score by 1, to a maximum of 20.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You learn three languages of your choice.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You can ably create written ciphers. Others can't decipher a code you create unless you teach them, they succeed on an Intelligence check (DC equal to your Intelligence score + your proficiency bonus), or they use magic to decipher it.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
